OL,3,ASapporo to move some beer production
OL,4,Afrom Canada to US after tariffs
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapanese brewer Sapporo says it will
OL,7,Fmove some beer production from Canada
OL,8,Fto the US after new tariffs on Canadian
OL,9,Fbeer took effect on Tuesday.
OL,11,FThe move follows the introduction of a
OL,12,F50% tariff on beer imported from
OL,13,FCanada. For companies shipping beer
OL,14,Facross the border, that means
OL,15,Fsignificantly higher costs.
OL,17,FChief strategy officer Rieko Shofu
OL,18,Fdescribed tariffs as "something out of
OL,19,Four control," telling Bloomberg that
OL,20,Fthe beer giant would "move ahead with
OL,21,Flocal production."
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
