OL,3,ASapporo to move some beer production
OL,4,Afrom Canada to US after tariffs
OL,5,
OL,6,FSapporo did not immediately respond to
OL,7,Fthe BBC's request for comment. The
OL,8,Fcompany plans to shift production of
OL,9,Fits non-alcoholic beer, currently made
OL,10,Fin Canada for US customers, to the US
OL,11,Fby the first half of 2027.
